   "subject": "Using melt on table objects",
   "parts": [
    [
     3,
     "<div>I used melt on a table object and expected it to work the same as for matrices, but it doesn&#39;t. With matrices, it will use the names of the dimensions as column headers, but it doesn&#39;t seem to do the same thing for a table, even though the data structures are very similar.</div>\n\n<div><br></div><div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br>m &lt;- matrix(101:106, nrow=2, dimnames=list(therows=1:2, thecols=1:3))</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#        thecols</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># therows   1   2   3</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#       1 101 103 105</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#       2 102 104 106</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># It&#39;s an array</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><div>is.array(m)</div><div># TRUE</div></font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br>\n\n</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># This automatically sets column names to &#39;therows&#39; and &#39;thecols&#39;</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">melt(m)</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># therows thecols value</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#       1       1   101</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#       2       1   102</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#       1       2   103</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#       2       2   104</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#       1       3   105</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#       2       3   106</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br></font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br></font></span></div><div>\n\n<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># Convert it to a table</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">t &lt;- as.table(m)</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># The table object is an array</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">is.array(t)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># TRUE</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br></font></span></div><div><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># Structures are very similar</font></div>\n\n<div><div><div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">str(m)</font></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># int [1:2, 1:3] 101 102 103 104 105 106</font></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># - attr(*, &quot;dimnames&quot;)=List of 2</font></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#  ..$ therows: chr [1:2] &quot;1&quot; &quot;2&quot;</font></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#  ..$ thecols: chr [1:3] &quot;1&quot; &quot;2&quot; &quot;3&quot;</font></span></div></div></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">\n\n<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">str(t)</font></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># &#39;table&#39; int [1:2, 1:3] 101 102 103 104 105 106</font></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># - attr(*, &quot;dimnames&quot;)=List of 2</font></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#  ..$ therows: chr [1:2] &quot;1&quot; &quot;2&quot;</font></span></div>\n\n<div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#  ..$ thecols: chr [1:3] &quot;1&quot; &quot;2&quot; &quot;3&quot;</font></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">\n\n<font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><br></span></font></div></div></div></div><div><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><br></span></font></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># Melted table has strange column names</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">melt(t)</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"># value NA  NA</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#     1  1 101</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#     2  1 102</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#     1  2 103</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#     2  2 104</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#     1  3 105</font></span></div>\n\n<div><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\">#     2  3 106</font></span></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br></font></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n\n<font face=\"&#39;courier new&#39;, monospace\"><br></font></div>Is this the expected behavior? It seems odd to me.</div><div><br></div><div>-Winston</div>\n"
    ]
   ]
